# ROOFCAT: the screen scrolls steadily to the right. With no input Pepper
# rides along and keeps her place on the screen; LEFT walks her back through
# the town and RIGHT runs ahead, at the same pace against the screen. In the
# boss arena, where the scroll stops, she walks both ways.
game roofcat
wait 20
press A
wait 75
expect state == 2
cheat clear_foes
expect screen_x == 48
wait 60
expect screen_x == 48
expect px == 81
# LEFT: she walks back through the town (1.3 px a frame against the screen)
hold LEFT 15
expect px == 68
expect screen_x == 28
# no input again: carried at the screen's pace, so she stays at 28
wait 30
expect screen_x == 28
# RIGHT: the same pace the other way
hold RIGHT 20
expect screen_x == 54
expect grounded == 1
# the arena: the screen stands still, and so does she until she walks
cheat area 4 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat arena
wait 30
expect px == 16661
wait 20
expect px == 16661
hold LEFT 10
expect px == 16647
hold RIGHT 20
expect px == 16674
